      "description": "The user is projected onto the visual material of the child being held by the horse, as this scene represents the starting point of the narrative and is implicitly associated with the viewer's own past or potential past. The absence of explicit deictic pronouns like 'me' or 'you' means the projection is indirect, relying on the universal relatability of childhood experiences and the time-lapse narrative.",
